			"instruction": "In the installed Vulkan editor, select GPU Animation Validation GPU Hero and open Animation Diagnostics. Keep that diagnostics window open for the scripted Play-stage detailed snapshots. Through the real AnimatorComponent controls, request Auto, Force GPU Visual, Force Hybrid Authoritative, and Force CPU Deterministic/Fallback; for each request inspect the effective mode, selection or fallback reason, pose residency, authoritative subset, GPU work, transfer/readback/wait counters, and mode-switch history. Restore requestedMode to Auto and leave the editor stopped before completing this item. Do not collect or compare timing or throughput thresholds in this power-limited run."
